    {
      "q": "How do you play Sudoku Classic 9x9?",
      "a": "Place numbers 1 to 9 into empty cells. Each number can only appear once per row, once per column, and once in each of the nine 3x3 subgrids."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can I use notes or pencil marks?",
      "a": "Yes, toggle the Notes button (pencil icon) to jot down candidate numbers in any cell."
    },
